fragment_downloaded_cb({"url":"codecs/gsth265decoder.html#gst_h265_decoder_get_sps_ext","fragment":"\n\tgst_h265_decoder_get_sps_ext\n\n\n\tGstCodecs.H265Decoder.prototype.get_sps_ext\n\n\n\tGstCodecs.H265Decoder.get_sps_ext\n\nRetrieve the extended SPS values attached to the given GstH265SPS\nParameters:\na GstH265Decoder\nthe GstH265SPS matching the requested GstH265SPSEXT\na GstH265SPSEXT if successful, or NULL otherwise\n\n\tSince\t\t\t: 1.28\n\t\t\nRetrieve the extended SPS values attached to the given GstCodecParsers.H265SPS\nParameters:\na GstCodecs.H265Decoder\nthe GstCodecParsers.H265SPS matching the requested GstCodecParsers.H265SPSEXT\na GstCodecParsers.H265SPSEXT if successful, or null otherwise\n\n\tSince\t\t\t: 1.28\n\t\t\nRetrieve the extended SPS values attached to the given GstCodecParsers.H265SPS\nParameters:\na GstCodecs.H265Decoder\nthe GstCodecParsers.H265SPS matching the requested GstCodecParsers.H265SPSEXT\na GstCodecParsers.H265SPSEXT if successful, or None otherwise\n\n\tSince\t\t\t: 1.28\n\t\t\n"});